### MEDIUM: gemini (gemini-code-assist[bot])
**File**: `script.js:74`
![medium](https://www.gstatic.com/codereviewagent/medium-priority.svg)

While modernizing the syntax is great, this is also an opportunity to improve efficiency and robustness. The current implementation iterates over the cloned DOM elements three separate times. This can be optimized by combining these into a single loop. Additionally, the current logic for prefixing IDs could create an ID like `cta-` if an element has an empty `id` attribute (e.g., `id=\"\"`). The suggested change combines the loops for better performance and adds a check to prefix IDs only if they are not empty, making the code more robust.

```suggestion
    clone.querySelectorAll('[id], [aria-controls], [aria-labelledby]').forEach((el) => {
        if (el.id) {
            el.id = PREFIX + el.id;
        }
        if (el.hasAttribute('aria-controls')) {
            el.setAttribute('aria-controls', PREFIX + el.getAttribute('aria-controls'));
        }
        if (el.hasAttribute('aria-labelledby')) {
            el.setAttribute('aria-labelledby', PREFIX + el.getAttribute('aria-labelledby'));
        }
    });
```

